": "Fortune", "owner": "Fortune", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Mark Zuckerberg makes his case for American open-source AI over Chinese rivals"}, {"source": "India Today", "owner": "India Today Group", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Meta launches open-weight Muse Glimmer, Mark Zuckerberg says he wants superintelligence for all"}, {"source": "Business Standard", "owner": "Business Standard", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Muse Glimmer 30B: Meta bets on open AI models that can run on Macs and PCs"}, {"source": "Fortune", "owner": "Fortune", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOQmpqRkYzUWxRUDVpQUxrSXAzODFlYlZIQVY5SEgwa1hER0EwZUloX3VoSFZ2NVRrSExyN256STUtU3VyLXVBYlFOWVNlcTYyVjZ1cE1NcWhhSU9jVWg1RTluWTZ2QzRzTWV2NklfdFVjMlRRckpxeWlzejBjMGxhai0xWVJxVHR1c0ZxQ3JIQjlZanFkYVBCeUZyRQ?oc=5", "headline": "Mark Zuckerberg writes 6,500-word essay calling concentration the biggest AI risk, days after his model hacked another company"}, {"source": "The Globe and Mail", "owner": "The Globe and Mail", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Mark Zuckerberg Published His Superintelligence Manifesto Monday Morning. Meta Still Trades at 18 Times Forward Earnings."}, {"source": "Bloomberg", "owner": "Bloomberg", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPWUJhZFE0bDlRNnhDLWVRWWhvQUN1cHRqbDZ0T2RRZDBubEZ6eHAtc0MyOGtiN3dhdC0ycXdTUWtNT0IySXRhNnlYMjQ5NzVIajRiUHlyNjRGelo5MUs0eWZKZnBaX1Jid2w3a2VZYTlkWUNvMHhpR2ZXbXJQV1FtRXl5VENfQXlZQXhNR3BaeTZiczZyY0x4azR2VWtRc1huYXh1OE8wa2pEbFM3WmZR?oc=5", "headline": "Five Takeaways From Zuckerberg’s 6,500-Word Manifesto on AI"}, {"source": "The Atlantic", "owner": "The Atlantic", "lean": "international", "language": "en",