entagon finally admits: US strikes killed 153 civilians in Yemen in three attacks last year, 15 more incidents still under review"}, {"source": "The Pioneer", "owner": "The Pioneer", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQYmVITFYxOHJaOGVjMzE0Z0JodjBuUHpPUXByeEdHd2lCZUViVi00bnlIWXpDa21VcjZQVDh6OWZvbjVYYW1aaVdZTmpncG9NeW9LM3NSRkRUenk5c0ptalFIQk53Sk9Gd1FjWWRjcVoxeU5TNlFZWEJkTnpLWXVhRTg2M2J5MmNpRTFHaGF5NXk4ektJeGc2QVhUbzBfaHd4NjNB?oc=5", "headline": "U.S. airstrikes killed over 150 civilians in Yemen in 2025, Pentagon finds"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "US strikes in Yemen killed 153 civilians in 2025, says Pentagon review"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/us-attack-on-yemen-killed-153-civilians-in-april-2025-pentagon-review/articleshow/133197963.cms", "headline": "US attack on Yemen killed 153 civilians in April 2025: Pentagon review"}, {"source": "Euronews", "owner": "Euronews", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "http://www.euronews.com/2026/08/13/us-strikes-targeting-houthis-killed-153-civilians-in-yemen-last-year-pentagon-review-says", "headline": "US strikes targeting Houthis killed 153 civilians in Yemen last year, Pentagon review says"}, {"source": "The Pioneer", "owner": "The Pioneer", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://dailypioneer.com/news/us-airstrikes-killed-over-150-civilians-in-yemen-in-2025-pentagon-finds", "headline": "U . S . airstrikes killed over 150 civilians in Yemen in 2025 , Pentagon finds"}, {"source": "CBS News", "owner": "CBS News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPYklXZHdyRmIxN3ctT2kzOGRmcUc4RC1aMFVTODdHbDlKcVZTWmR2RDAzaHRub0UzNFZFQmJnRkNGUlZsNVY1QWFDSW5hTE1JNF