eeks second term"}, {"source": "Associated Press", "owner": "Associated Press", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNZS1vOGdEXzFqSE9VdHZkblc0dlV0Qi05YjRrZER5eGFhT21neW1iTWNWSHgtOExPem1zQnBDVmtrS3JoaWMwM1laQ1lPWDJleU9IbmtUVE1oaVJzcHM5b3F3N1FTdGk0aUVLZ3ZuVlQ2R0g0WmRTS3VDRE9Edk95Y1htNlNvMHZadUlORHVIcGMyVlVBcFRpbUxaamNFQW5H?oc=5", "headline": "Zambia suspends vote counting in election over reports of violence and the theft of ballot papers"}, {"source": "BBC News", "owner": "BBC News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c5yr8r04edvo", "headline": "Presidential vote counting halted in Zambia over alleged attacks on polling staff"}, {"source": "France 24", "owner": "France 24", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/africa/20260814-zambia-suspends-election-vote-counting-over-reports-of-violence", "headline": "Zambia suspends vote count nationwide amid reports of violence, ballot theft"}, {"source": "Deutsche Welle", "owner": "Deutsche Welle", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/zambia-suspends-vote-count-after-violence/a-78368601", "headline": "Zambia suspends vote count after violence"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/8/14/zambia-suspends-vote-counting-in-election-citing-violence?traffic_source=rss", "headline": "Zambia suspends vote counting in election citing violence"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Zambia suspends vote counting in election citing violence"}, {"source": "The New York Times", "owner": "The New York Times", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/14/world/africa/zambia-election-vote-count-suspended-president.html", "headline": "Zambia Halts Presidential Election Vote Count Over Violence and Fraud Allegations"}, {"source": "The Independent", "owner": "The Independent", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/africa/zambia-election-vote-count-suspended-violence-b3033268.html", "headline": "Zambia election chaos erupts as vote count halted over alleged violence and ballot paper theft"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Zambia’s Hichilema leads presidential vote count"}]'::jsonb, '{"title": "Zambia Votes in Presidential Election Amid Economic Challenges", "summary": "Zambians cast their ballots on Thursday in a general election where incumbent President Hakainde Hichilema is widely expected to win a second term. The election is seen as a test of his economic reforms amidst voter frustration over the cost of living, inflation, and debt restructuring. Key issues shaping the vote include economic recovery, youth turnout, and women''s representation. The election also takes place against the backdrop of a continuing feud between Hichilema and the family of his predecessor, Edgar Lungu.", "summary_points": ["Zambians voted on Thursday in a general election.", "President Hakainde Hichilema is seeking a second term.", "The election is testing his economic reforms against voter frustration over the cost of living and inflation.", "Key issues include economic recovery, youth turnout, and women''s representation.", "The election is also influenced by the legacy of former president Edgar Lungu."], "title_hi": "जाम्बिया में आर्थिक चुनौतियों के बीच राष्ट्रपति चुनाव के लिए मतदान", "summary_hi": "जाम्बिया में गुरुवार को एक आम चुनाव में मतदान हुआ, जहाँ निवर्तमान राष्ट्रपति हकाइंदे हिचिलेमा से दूसरे कार्यकाल के लिए व्यापक रूप से जीतने की उम्मीद है। यह चुनाव व्यापक आर्थिक निराशा, मुद्रास्फीति और ऋण पुनर्गठन के बीच उनके आर्थिक सुधारों की परीक्षा है। मतदान को आकार देने वाले प्रमुख मुद्दों में आर्थिक सुधार, युवा मतदान और महिलाओं का प्रतिनिधित्व शामिल है। यह चुनाव पूर्व राष्ट्रपति एडगर लुंगु के परिवार के साथ हिचिलेमा के चल रहे झगड़े की पृष्ठभूमि में भी हो रहा है।", "summary_points_hi": ["जाम्बिया में गुरुवार को एक आम चुनाव के लिए मतदान हुआ।", "राष्ट्रपति हकाइंदे हिचिलेमा दूसरे कार्यकाल की तलाश में हैं।", "यह चुनाव जीवन यापन की लागत और मुद्रास्फीति से जूझ रहे मतदाताओं के सामने उनके आर्थिक सुधारों की परीक्षा ले रहा है।", "प्रमुख मुद्दों में आर्थिक सुधार, युवा मतदान और महिलाओं का प्रतिनिधित्व शामिल है।", "यह चुनाव पूर्व राष्ट्रपति एडगर लुंगु की विरासत की पृष्ठभूमि में भी हो रहा है।"], "framing": {"center": ["The sole centrist outlet highlighted President Hichilema''s expected win and the economic challenges testing his reforms.", "This coverage noted the election is a test of his reforms against voter frustration over the cost of living and opposition parties seeking to capitalize on discontent."], "right": ["The sole right-leaning outlet framed the election around the incumbent president seeking a second term."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["एकमात्र मध्यमार्गी आउटलेट ने राष्ट्रपति हिचिलेमा की अपेक्षित जीत और उनके सुधारों को परखने वाली आर्थिक चुनौतियों पर प्रकाश डाला।", "इस कवरेज में उल्लेख किया गया है कि यह चुनाव जीवन यापन की लागत से मतदाताओं की निराशा और असंतोष का लाभ उठाने की कोशिश कर रही विपक्षी पार्टियों के खिलाफ उनके सुधारों की परीक्षा है।"], "right": ["एकमात्र दक्षिणपंथी आउटलेट ने चुनाव को निवर्तमान राष्ट्रपति द्वारा दूसरे कार्यकाल की तलाश के इर्द-गिर्द केंद्रित किया।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://static.dw.com/image/78324579_6.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Deutsche Welle", "owner": "Deutsche Welle", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/key-issues-in-zambias-2026-general-election/a-78320087", "headline": "Key issues in Zambia 2026 general election"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "left", "language": "